<</nobr>>

:: Day2_Afternoon_C_Refuse [day2 afternoon lily nails refuse]
<<nobr>>
<p>"Nah, I'm good."</p>

<p>She shrugs. One shoulder lift, quick and dismissive. "Whatever, boring." She goes back to her own nails. We sit in comfortable silence, the kind that comes from proximity and familiarity and having nothing to prove to each other. She shows me TikToks on her phone, reactions to reactions to reactions, the infinite regress of internet content. I laugh at a few. She explains references I don't get. Normal stuff.</p>

<p>But I notice the way her eyes keep flicking to my feet. Measuring. Planning. Lily doesn't accept "no" as a permanent answer. She accepts it as a "not yet."</p>

<<statChange "resistance" 2>>
<<set $lilyRelationship += 1>>
<<set $lilyNailsDay2 to true>>
<<spendTime 1>>
<<set $currentMapLocation to "home">>

<<link "Continue" "DailyHub">><</link>>
<</nobr>>
